{"id":"1c53f8b465048897","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-perfect-set-property.md","title":"Perfect Set Theorem for Borel Sets","display":"thm-perfect-set-property — Perfect Set Theorem for Borel Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-perfect-set-property","aliases":["58-thm-perfect-set-property","Borel perfect set theorem"],"display":"thm-perfect-set-property — Perfect Set Theorem for Borel Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-perfect.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","[[58-df-polish-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-perfect-set-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-perfect-set-property</span><span>Borel perfect set theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-perfect-set-property — Perfect Set Theorem for Borel Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" href=\"?note=f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-perfect.md\">../batch08/58-df-perfect.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"58-df-polish-space.md\">58-df-polish-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,P,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},d_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\">\\(A,P,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},d_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>（Borel 集谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span>（带载体和度量的完美集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" href=\"?note=f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-perfect.md\">../batch08/58-df-perfect.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\to\n\\left(\n|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\lor\n\\exists P\\,\n\\bigl(\\varnothing\\neq P\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\to\n\\left(\n|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\lor\n\\exists P\\,\n\\bigl(\\varnothing\\neq P\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every Borel set of reals is countable or contains a nonempty perfect subset; in the latter case it has cardinality continuum.</li>\n<li>The same perfect-set conclusion holds for analytic sets, while extensions to wider definability classes require separate hypotheses.</li>\n<li>完美性使用上游三元谓词，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S\\)</span> 保证 Borel 结构与完美性来自同一个欧氏度量拓扑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-perfect.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6afc84fe5b2b44e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-perfect.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-perfect.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6afc84fe5b2b44e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})$（带载体和度量的完美集谓词，见 [[../batch08/58-df-perfect.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,P,\\tau_{\\mathbb R},d_{\\mathbb R}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S(d_{\\mathbb R},\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\to\n\\left(\n|A|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\lor\n\\exists P\\,\n\\bigl(\\varnothing\\neq P\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InducesTopology}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1730,"backlinks":[{"id":"a13c936d7f94577d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4a9d4e1d13641a1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4355","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-perfect-set-property.md|58-thm-perfect-set-property]]（batch17）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-abs